# =============================================================================
# POLAR-RM (rm_custom_client) — Git ignore rules
# Repo: https://github.com/lulunomaro/polar-rm-client
# Only infrastructure; does not change application source.
# =============================================================================

# --- Python env / bytecode ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Local editor / agent scratch ---
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS junk ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Runtime caches (regenerable) ---
.wallpaper_cache/
*.log

# --- Temp / debug render dumps (do not version) ---
tmp_render_checks/
tmp_selfcheck/
tmp_*/
# 本机跑 golden / 编译体检时留下的抓帧日志与源码快照，别让 git add -A 顺手带走
_golden_out.txt
kernel.errors.txt
tmp_*.zip
tmp_*.json
_backup_*/

# --- Release archives (large; rebuild with tools/build_release.ps1) ---
release/*.zip
release/**/*.zip

# --- User-imported wallpapers (local only) ---
assets/wallpapers/user/

# --- Large built-in video wallpapers (keep on disk, not in git) ---
# Re-add with Git LFS later if you need them in the remote.
assets/wallpapers/**/*.mp4
assets/wallpapers/**/*.webm
assets/wallpapers/**/*.mov
assets/wallpapers/**/*.mkv
assets/wallpapers/**/*.avi

# --- Machine-local calibration data ---
calibrations/*
!calibrations/.gitkeep

# --- Optional: ignore entire unpacked release tree under release/ ---
release/POLAR-RM_Custom_Client_*/

# Portable runtime state / qualification evidence (never source controlled)
field_evidence/
logs/
user_data/
build/
dist/
*.spec.bak
_pdf_extract.txt

# 第 94 轮：门禁自己在工作树里拉的射存目录。
#
# 根因（实测）：**本机的 `tempfile.gettempdir()` 解析到仓库根目录**，
# 而郣些套件用不带 `dir=` 的 `tempfile.mkdtemp()`，所以它们的射存目录
# 落在**仓库里**。**已有 11 个这样的文件被跟踪，其中一个是我用 `git add -A` 误提交的。**
#
# 它们不是源码，不应进仓库；且它们会让 `git status` 永远不干净。
mgr_safety_manifest_*/
map_probe_*/
polar_doc_*/
polar_startup_userdata*/
verify_all_*/
verify_all_*/
spec_bad_*/
